e\": \"Changed QA Test Gadget Edited's category assignment from Tech Gadgets to Home Goods via edit form combobox; change correctly reflected in admin list, /products list, and detail page category badge.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Selecting \\\"Fitness\\\" category filter on /products instantly returned exactly the 3 correctly-categorized Fitness products (Bowflex, Theragun, Peloton), excluding all Tech/Home items.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/products lists all products as cards showing image, category badge, price, name, short description, star rating value, and a \\\"Buy Now\\\" purchase link for each item.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Minimum Rating filter \\\"4.5+ stars\\\" correctly reduced 10→9 products, excluding only Philips Hue Starter Kit (4.4). Price Range minimum slider raised to $120 correctly reduced 10→9 products, excluding only QA Test Gadget 2 ($0); all remaining listed prices ($199-$2495) were ≥$120.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Category combobox in product create/edit form and filter offers exactly 3 fixed options: Tech Gadgets, Home Goods, Fitness (plus \\\"All Categories\\\" in filter context). No free-text entry or ability to add a new category.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Category filter (Fitness), rating filter (4.5+), and price minimum ($120) each returned result sets whose members strictly satisfied the given criteria with no extraneous items included.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Category, rating, and price-slider filter changes updated the product count and list immediately without a page reload or 